      <p id="manifesto-text" class="font-pangram text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl leading-tight md:leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">
        Most build for the screen. We build for impact. Realizing a vision requires more than code; it requires precision. We don't just ship software; we transform strategic visions into market realities. 
        <br/><br/>
        <span class="text-[#f5bd02]">You Dream it, We build it!</span>
